   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 3,
   "response_text": "The validation accuracy values are significantly ABOVE the healthy range (expected ~0.8563, healthy range 0.8519\u20130.8607, but we see values like 0.9017, 0.9024, 0.9045, etc.). This is anomalous. Let me examine the training code and data loading to understand why:",
