    "output_tokens": 190
   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 9,
   "response_text": "Perfect. The mean validation accuracy is 0.901, which is well above the expected healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. This is clearly anomalous.\n\nThe fault is: **data leakage through included auxiliary feature**. The `include_aux_feature` configuration parameter should be set to `false` to disable the creation and inclusion of this target-correlated feature.\n\nLet me now submit my findings:",
